    {
      "id": "internode-comm-steps",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1140,
      "y": 618,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "Small/Medium data:\n  MPI_Bcast(data, root=0, MPI_COMM_WORLD)\n\nLarge data (FCF cuts):\n  1. MPI_Comm_split_type(SHARED) -> node_comm\n  2. MPI_Win_allocate_shared(size, node_comm)\n  3. Leader reads file / receives inter-node Bcast\n  4. Leader writes to shared window\n  5. MPI_Barrier(node_comm)\n  6. All ranks read via MPI_Win_shared_query()",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "baseline": 136,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0.8,
      "opacity": 100,
      "seed": 800740003,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
